{{SYSTEM_VARS_DOCS}}

## Custom variables

Add any `KEY=value` to `coordination/PROJECT.env` and reference via
`${name}` in this file, in skill bodies, MCP server configs, or any
subprocess. `greatminds start-agent` sources `PROJECT.env` before
launching each agent, so the values appear in the agent's
environment.

## Project context

Free-form prose: project name, root path, stack overview, deploy
recipe, etc. Edit as needed.

The legacy angle-bracket table format is removed — write prose
directly and reference env vars via `${name}` shell form.
